n this Yale College moment  now you're prepped for the days ahead  but you're also just here and that's an  increasingly challenging place to be  after all you are all multitaskers used  to being both where your body may be but  still with your friends in other places  and time zones you're not texting in  fact I see no little glow of your of  phones that would tell me you were  texting or reading you're paying  attention to social cues to the presence  of others here in the room with you how  they see you too recognizing that you're  now becoming part of something larger  than yourself and that you're now a  berkeley aight a gnome a morsel a  pearson aight a cylinder  or a red lion be in the moment 2015 be  brave allow yourself to fall under the  spell of what you uncover or rediscover  as you come to understand the world in  front of you you will change it and it  will change you thank you
 

